@convince_ddp_eckener
view-if: not lvp_formed and eckener_campaign and not ddp_support_marcher
max-visits: 1
go-to: convince_ddp_success_eckener if (ddp_relation >= 40 and (ddp_ideology == "Right" or dstp_maintained)) or (ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate" and not dstp_maintained) or (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left" and not dstp_maintained); convince_ddp_fail_eckener if not ((ddp_relation >= 40 and (ddp_ideology == "Right" or dstp_maintained)) or (ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate" and not dstp_maintained) or (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left" and not dstp_maintained))

The <span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberal</span> vote has been falling over time, especially during the current economic calamity, so they will probably be of minimal help. Still, every little bit counts.

@convince_ddp_success_eckener
on-arrival: ddp_support_marcher = 1; ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; ddp_relation += 3
go-to: round2_menu

