The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> is committed to supporting Ernst Halsmark. [? if (collectivist_relation >= 55 and collectivist_leader != "Conciliators" or collectivist_relation >= 40 and collectivist_leader == "Conciliators") : However, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span>-DuFour coalition worries them enough that they are willing to be convinced to drop their campaign and support Bristol. ?][? if (collectivist_relation < 55 and collectivist_leader != "Conciliators" or collectivist_relation < 40 and collectivist_leader == "Conciliators") : They do not seem willing to be convinced. ?]

