Hopefully the Commonwealth makes the right choice. [? if dufour_confidence: With DuFour’s campaign losing strength now that his victory seems assured, [+ royalist_candidate_1932 +]’s effort remains in full swing. The lack of activity from DuFour’s camp is likely to fuel a resurgence for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>. ?]

[? if lib_drop_out_2: Fortunately for us, [+ liberal_reactionary_candidate_1932_name +] has dropped out due to our courting of the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberals</span>. ?][? if unionist_drop_out_2: Fortunately for us, [+ center_reactionary_candidate_1932_name +] has dropped out due to our courting of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]. ?]

[? if vorbeck_trolling: However, the withdrawal of [? if liberal_reactionary_candidate_1932: [+ liberal_reactionary_candidate_1932_name +] and?][+ center_reactionary_candidate_1932_name +] has forced the entry of [+ reactionary_candidate_1932 +] into the race, serving as a candidate for the moderate right. ?]

@hindenburg_wins
on-arrival: president = "DuFour"

As expected, the incumbent DuFour wins the presidency. Let's hope he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@thalmann_wins
on-arrival: president = "Halsmark"; collectivist_relation = 80;

Ernst Halsmark of the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> has won the presidency. Immediately, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> launches a coup attempt against the government. We have no choice but to unite with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span>...

- @civil_war: This is civil war.

@hitler_wins
on-arrival: president = royalist_candidate_1932; chancellor = "Gallax"; chancellor_party = "Royalist"

[? if royalist_candidate_1932 == "Gallax" : Alaric Gallax of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> has won the presidency. He wastes no time in consolidating power. ?]
[? if royalist_candidate_1932 != "Gallax" : The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> candidate [+ president +] has won. The first action President [+ president +] takes is inviting Gallax back into the Commonwealth, and appointing him chancellor. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> waste no time in consolidating power. ?]

- @hitler_takes_power: What do we do now?


@braun_wins
