@jarres_win
on-arrival: president = "Jarrow"; president_ideology = "Right"; burgher_gold += 4; guild_gold += 4; landed_gold += 4; burgher_lvp += 4; guild_lvp += 4; landed_lvp += 4
achievement: aller_guten_dinge_sind_zwei

Perhaps surprisingly, Lorne Jarrow has made an unforeseen comeback and won the presidency. We hope that his governance will be an improvement over that of DuFour, and that he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power. 

@gessler_win
on-arrival: president = "Gesling"; president_ideology = "Moderate"; burgher_ddp += 2; guild_ddp += 2; landed_ddp += 2; burgher_gold += 2; guild_gold += 2; landed_gold += 2; burgher_lvp += 4; guild_lvp += 4; landed_lvp += 4

Gareth Gesling has made a comeback and won the presidency. Despite his[? if lvp_formed: &nbsp;former?] affiliation with the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Golds**</span>, he isn’t as friendly as his colleagues. However, he is a significant step up from DuFour. Let’s hope he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@luther_win
on-arrival: president = "Lytton"; president_ideology = "Moderate"; burgher_gold += 4; guild_gold += 4; landed_gold += 4; burgher_lvp += 4; guild_lvp += 4; landed_lvp += 4

From former Chancellor to President, Hans Lytton has secured the presidency. Known for his technocratic beliefs, he's unlikely to rock the boat in either political direction. Let’s hope he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@adenauer_win
on-arrival: president = "Aldermoor"; president_ideology = "Moderate"; commons_unionist += 4; burgher_unionist += 6; guild_unionist += 6; landed_unionist += 4; faithful_unionist += 4
go-to: bundesrepublik if presidential_powers

Konrad Aldermoor has risen from Mayor to President and is expected to pursue friendlier policies toward the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> than DuFour. Still, let's hope he remains firm in keeping the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@bundesrepublik
achievement: bundesrepublik


@bruning_win
on-arrival: president = "Askew"; president_ideology = "Moderate"; burgher_unionist += 4; guild_unionist += 4; landed_unionist += 2; faithful_unionist += 2

Edmund Askew may be an advocate of economic austerity, but as president, he’s a clear step up from DuFour in both his <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> convictions and his stance toward the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>. Let’s hope he stands firm and keeps the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@stegerwald_win
on-arrival: president = "Sedgewick"; president_ideology = "Moderate"; commons_unionist += 8; burgher_unionist += 6; guild_unionist += 6; landed_unionist += 4; faithful_unionist += 4

Adam Sedgewick has risen from Free Guild president to President of the Commonwealth. He is expected to pursue friendlier policies toward the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> than DuFour did, and to provide a voice for the laborers of the Commonwealth. Let's hope he remains firm in keeping the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

@vorbeck_win
on-arrival: president = "Lethmoor"; president_ideology = "Right"; vorbeck_party = "Traditionalist"; vorbeck_party = "CPP" if kvp_formed; vorbeck_party = "Other" if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" and not kvp_formed; commons_traditionalist += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Traditionalist"; burgher_traditionalist += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Traditionalist"; guild_traditionalist += 6 if vorbeck_party == "Traditionalist"; landed_traditionalist += 6 if vorbeck_party == "Traditionalist"; faithful_traditionalist += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Traditionalist"; commons_kvp += 4 if vorbeck_party == "CPP"; burgher_kvp += 4 if vorbeck_party == "CPP"; guild_kvp += 6 if vorbeck_party == "CPP"; landed_kvp += 6 if vorbeck_party == "CPP"; faithful_kvp += 4 if vorbeck_party == "CPP"; commons_other += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Other"; burgher_other += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Other"; guild_other += 6 if vorbeck_party == "Other"; landed_other += 6 if vorbeck_party == "Other"; faithful_other += 4 if vorbeck_party == "Other"; 

Unfortunately, Cedric Lethmoor, a <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> not far different from DuFour, has been elected president. A return to government under his leadership—his Camarilla certainly won’t allow it. Let’s hope he holds the line against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and abandons the dangerous taming strategy.

@westarp_win
on-arrival: president = "Westmore"; president_ideology = "Right"; westarp_party = "Traditionalist"; westarp_party = "CPP" if kvp_formed; westarp_party = "Other" if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" and not kvp_formed; commons_traditionalist += 2 if westarp_party == "Traditionalist"; burgher_traditionalist += 4 if westarp_party == "Traditionalist"; guild_traditionalist += 6 if westarp_party == "Traditionalist"; landed_traditionalist += 6 if westarp_party == "Traditionalist"; faithful_traditionalist += 2 if westarp_party == "Traditionalist"; commons_kvp += 2 if westarp_party == "CPP"; burgher_kvp += 4 if westarp_party == "CPP"; guild_kvp += 6 if westarp_party == "CPP"; landed_kvp += 6 if westarp_party == "CPP"; faithful_kvp += 2 if westarp_party == "CPP"; commons_other += 2 if westarp_party == "Other"; burgher_other += 4 if westarp_party == "Other"; guild_other += 6 if westarp_party == "Other"; landed_other += 6 if westarp_party == "Other"; faithful_other += 2 if westarp_party == "Other"; 

Unfortunately, Edgar Westmore, a known <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span>, has been elected president. It’s unlikely we’ll return to government under his leadership. Let’s hope he holds the line against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>—and abandons his dangerous taming strategy.